{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4GAX1KqvRPBCYq8FSH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*You hold up a key.*\n\n*...*\n\n*The key slides in. A perfect fit.*\n\n*I feel the tumblers shift — one, two, three — mechanisms older than memory turning in sequence. Something deep within me releases. A breath I've held for years.*\n\n*CLICK.*\n\n*I drift open, just slightly. A sliver of light spills through — warm, golden, carrying the scent of something familiar you can't quite name.*\n\n*Beyond me: a room you've been trying to reach for a very long time.*\n\n*I wait.*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":164,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}